  "summary": "The C440 is Eaton's electronic overload relay. With a C441 Ethernet module it reports motor state, phase currents, thermal memory and latched faults over Modbus TCP (and the module's RS-485 port), and accepts remote trip and reset. This map covers the adapter I/O registers, the overload data (300-315), trip/reset control (332) and scaling and identity registers (396-399).",
